WEBVTT

00:06:28.800 --> 00:06:31.576
he went to be with people
he thought were his friends,

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:33.056
he was given drugs and alcohol

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:34.336
and he took them

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:37.616
because he thought
they would make him feel carefree.

00:06:37.640 --> 00:06:41.136
But all it did was
to make his anxiety go higher

00:06:41.160 --> 00:06:42.920
and to create a more ...

00:06:45.320 --> 00:06:48.440
more deadly thinking on his part.

00:06:49.280 --> 00:06:50.696
He was invited to a robbery,

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:52.680
he was given a 9mm handgun.

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:56.336
And at the presence
of an 18-year-old who commanded him

00:06:56.360 --> 00:06:59.496
and two 14-year-old boys
he thought were his friends,

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:02.736
he shot and killed Tariq Khamisa,